{"id":"neo-brutalism-landing","title":"Neo-Brutalism — Modern Landing","description":"The 2021+ revival — thick black borders, hard colour-pop shadows (lime, pink, cyan on cream), playful rotation and oversized type. Friendlier and louder than classic brutalism; the Figma/Gumroad look.","tags":["neo-brutalism","landing-page","modern"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:55:13.003Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Neo-Brutalism — Modern Landing\ndescription: The 2021+ revival — thick black borders, hard colour-pop shadows (lime, pink, cyan on cream), playful rotation and oversized type. Friendlier and louder than classic brutalism; the Figma/Gumroad look.\ntags: [neo-brutalism, landing-page, modern]\norder: 15\n---\n\n# Neo-Brutalism — Modern Landing\n\nNot the 2016 brutalism in this library — the friendly revival: cream background, candy\ncolour blocks (lime, pink, cyan, yellow), 3px black borders, hard `6px 6px 0 #111`\nshadows in colour, slight corner radius and a rotating sticker.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#f5f1e8` cream |\n| Ink | `#111` borders, shadows, text |\n| Pops | lime `#b9ff66` · pink `#ff90e8` · cyan `#90e0ef` · yellow `#ffd43b` |\n| Shadow | `6px 6px 0 #111`, grows to `10px 10px` on hover |\n| Type | system sans, 750-weight headlines, highlighted marker spans |\n\n## Pieces\n\nPill nav → hero with marker-highlighted headline + rotating ✺ sticker → lime marquee →\nthree colour cards that lift on hover → working FAQ accordion → black footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Neo-Brutalism — Modern Landing\n\nNot the 2016 brutalism in this library — the friendly revival: cream background, candy\ncolour blocks (lime, pink, cyan, yellow), 3px black borders, hard `6px 6px 0 #111`\nshadows in colour, slight corner radius and a rotating sticker.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#f5f1e8` cream |\n| Ink | `#111` borders, shadows, text |\n| Pops | lime `#b9ff66` · pink `#ff90e8` · cyan `#90e0ef` · yellow `#ffd43b` |\n| Shadow | `6px 6px 0 #111`, grows to `10px 10px` on hover |\n| Type | system sans, 750-weight headlines, highlighted marker spans |\n\n## Pieces\n\nPill nav → hero with marker-highlighted headline + rotating ✺ sticker → lime marquee →\nthree colour cards that lift on hover → working FAQ accordion → black footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>BLOK! — Neo-Brutalism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --ink: #111; --cream: #f5f1e8; --lime: #b9ff66; --pink: #ff90e8; --cyan: #90e0ef; --yellow: #ffd43b; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); }\n  ::selection { background: var(--lime); }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n\n  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 22px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; background: var(--pink); border: 3px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); padding: 4px 12px; transform: rotate(-2deg); }\n  .menu { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n  .menu a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 8px 14px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: #fff; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); border-radius: 10px; transition: all 0.12s; }\n  .menu a:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .menu .cta { background: var(--yellow); }\n\n  header { padding: 60px 0 50px; position: relative; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 7.5vw, 78px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; max-width: 760px; }\n  .hl { padding: 0 10px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .hl.lime { background: var(--lime); } .hl.pink { background: var(--pink); }\n  .sticker { position: absolute; top: 46px; right: 60px; width: 84px; height: 84px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 40px; background: var(--cyan); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); animation: spin 9s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n  .sub { margin: 24px 0 30px; font-size: 16.5px; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; max-width: 480px; }\n  .btns { display: flex; gap: 14px; }\n  .big { font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; padding: 13px 24px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.12s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }\n  .big.lime { background: var(--lime); } .big.plain { background: #fff; }\n  .big:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .big:active { transform: translate(3px, 3px); box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink); }\n\n  .marquee { background: var(--lime); border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }\n  .marquee div { display: inline-flex; white-space: nowrap; padding: 11px 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; animation: slide 16s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes slide { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; padding: 60px 0; }\n  .card { border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 22px 28px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.15s; }\n  .card:hover { transform: translate(-3px, -3px); box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .card .ic { width: 54px; height: 54px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .card p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; }\n  .card.pink { background: var(--pink); } .card.cyan { background: var(--cyan); } .card.yell { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .card .ic { background: #fff; }\n\n  .faq { padding: 10px 0 70px; }\n  .faq h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .q { border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }\n  .q > button { width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border: 0; background: none; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px; padding: 16px 18px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; }\n  .q .plus { font-size: 22px; transition: transform 0.25s; flex: none; }\n  .q.open .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  .q .a { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease; }\n  .q.open .a { max-height: 200px; }\n  .q .a p { padding: 0 18px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; }\n  .q:nth-child(1) > button { background: var(--pink); }\n  .q:nth-child(2) > button { background: var(--cyan); }\n  .q:nth-child(3) > button { background: var(--yellow); }\n\n  footer { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); padding: 34px 0; }\n  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }\n  footer .flogo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; background: var(--lime); color: var(--ink); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 8px; transform: rotate(-2deg); display: inline-block; }\n  footer small { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.75; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 740px) { .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sticker { display: none; } .menu a:not(.cta) { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">BLOK!\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"menu\">\n        \u003ca href=\"#\">Work\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Hire us ↗\u003c/a>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sticker\">✺\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>We make websites\u003cbr>that look like \u003cspan class=\"hl lime\">this\u003c/span>\u003cbr>on \u003cspan class=\"hl pink\">purpose.\u003c/span>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub\">BLOK! is a two-person studio in Johor Bahru building loud, honest, slightly unhinged websites for brands with taste.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"btns\">\n        \u003ca class=\"big lime\" href=\"#\">See the work\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca class=\"big plain\" href=\"#\">Our manifesto\u003c/a>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"marquee\">\u003cdiv>\n    ✦ NO TEMPLATES ✦ NO GRADIENTS ✦ NO APOLOGIES ✦ BORDER ON EVERYTHING ✦ COLOUR ON EVERYTHING ELSE ✦&nbsp;\n    ✦ NO TEMPLATES ✦ NO GRADIENTS ✦ NO APOLOGIES ✦ BORDER ON EVERYTHING ✦ COLOUR ON EVERYTHING ELSE ✦&nbsp;\n  \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cards\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card pink\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">⚡\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Fast by default\u003c/h3>\u003cp>No frameworks, no build step, no 4MB of JavaScript. Just HTML, CSS and a sprinkle of vanilla JS.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card cyan\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">🎯\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Opinionated\u003c/h3>\u003cp>We will tell you your idea is bad before your users do. That is what you are paying for.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card yell\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">🧃\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Fun to use\u003c/h3>\u003cp>If a website feels like filling out a form at the bank, we have already failed. Play is a feature.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"faq\">\n      \u003ch2>Questions? Good.\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q open\">\n        \u003cbutton>Is this style actually usable? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Yes — borders and colour do the hierarchy work that subtle shadows normally do. Contrast is high, targets are big, and nothing important is hidden.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q\">\n        \u003cbutton>Why not just use a gradient like everyone else? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Because gradients whisper and blocks shout. Your brand deserves a website people screenshot and send to their friends.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q\">\n        \u003cbutton>How much does a site like this cost? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Less than you spent on the logo nobody can read. Every project is quoted flat — no hourly billing, no surprises.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan class=\"flogo\">BLOK!\u003c/span>\u003csmall>© 2026 Blok Studio JB — borders on everything, colour on everything else.\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    document.querySelectorAll('.q > button').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const item = btn.parentElement;\n        const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');\n        document.querySelectorAll('.q').forEach(q => q.classList.remove('open'));\n        if (!isOpen) item.classList.add('open');\n      });\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>BLOK! — Neo-Brutalism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --ink: #111; --cream: #f5f1e8; --lime: #b9ff66; --pink: #ff90e8; --cyan: #90e0ef; --yellow: #ffd43b; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); }\n  ::selection { background: var(--lime); }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n\n  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 22px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 21px; background: var(--pink); border: 3px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); padding: 4px 12px; transform: rotate(-2deg); }\n  .menu { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n  .menu a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 8px 14px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: #fff; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); border-radius: 10px; transition: all 0.12s; }\n  .menu a:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .menu .cta { background: var(--yellow); }\n\n  header { padding: 60px 0 50px; position: relative; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 7.5vw, 78px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; max-width: 760px; }\n  .hl { padding: 0 10px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .hl.lime { background: var(--lime); } .hl.pink { background: var(--pink); }\n  .sticker { position: absolute; top: 46px; right: 60px; width: 84px; height: 84px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 40px; background: var(--cyan); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); animation: spin 9s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n  .sub { margin: 24px 0 30px; font-size: 16.5px; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; max-width: 480px; }\n  .btns { display: flex; gap: 14px; }\n  .big { font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; padding: 13px 24px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.12s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }\n  .big.lime { background: var(--lime); } .big.plain { background: #fff; }\n  .big:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px); box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .big:active { transform: translate(3px, 3px); box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink); }\n\n  .marquee { background: var(--lime); border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }\n  .marquee div { display: inline-flex; white-space: nowrap; padding: 11px 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; animation: slide 16s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes slide { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; padding: 60px 0; }\n  .card { border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 22px 28px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.15s; }\n  .card:hover { transform: translate(-3px, -3px); box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--ink); }\n  .card .ic { width: 54px; height: 54px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 25px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .card p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; }\n  .card.pink { background: var(--pink); } .card.cyan { background: var(--cyan); } .card.yell { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .card .ic { background: #fff; }\n\n  .faq { padding: 10px 0 70px; }\n  .faq h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .q { border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; margin-bottom: 14px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }\n  .q > button { width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border: 0; background: none; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px; padding: 16px 18px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; }\n  .q .plus { font-size: 22px; transition: transform 0.25s; flex: none; }\n  .q.open .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  .q .a { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease; }\n  .q.open .a { max-height: 200px; }\n  .q .a p { padding: 0 18px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 500; color: #3d3a33; }\n  .q:nth-child(1) > button { background: var(--pink); }\n  .q:nth-child(2) > button { background: var(--cyan); }\n  .q:nth-child(3) > button { background: var(--yellow); }\n\n  footer { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); padding: 34px 0; }\n  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }\n  footer .flogo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; background: var(--lime); color: var(--ink); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 8px; transform: rotate(-2deg); display: inline-block; }\n  footer small { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.75; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 740px) { .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sticker { display: none; } .menu a:not(.cta) { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">BLOK!\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"menu\">\n        \u003ca href=\"#\">Work\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">About\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Hire us ↗\u003c/a>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sticker\">✺\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>We make websites\u003cbr>that look like \u003cspan class=\"hl lime\">this\u003c/span>\u003cbr>on \u003cspan class=\"hl pink\">purpose.\u003c/span>\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub\">BLOK! is a two-person studio in Johor Bahru building loud, honest, slightly unhinged websites for brands with taste.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"btns\">\n        \u003ca class=\"big lime\" href=\"#\">See the work\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca class=\"big plain\" href=\"#\">Our manifesto\u003c/a>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"marquee\">\u003cdiv>\n    ✦ NO TEMPLATES ✦ NO GRADIENTS ✦ NO APOLOGIES ✦ BORDER ON EVERYTHING ✦ COLOUR ON EVERYTHING ELSE ✦&nbsp;\n    ✦ NO TEMPLATES ✦ NO GRADIENTS ✦ NO APOLOGIES ✦ BORDER ON EVERYTHING ✦ COLOUR ON EVERYTHING ELSE ✦&nbsp;\n  \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"cards\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card pink\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">⚡\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Fast by default\u003c/h3>\u003cp>No frameworks, no build step, no 4MB of JavaScript. Just HTML, CSS and a sprinkle of vanilla JS.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card cyan\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">🎯\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Opinionated\u003c/h3>\u003cp>We will tell you your idea is bad before your users do. That is what you are paying for.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"card yell\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic\">🧃\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Fun to use\u003c/h3>\u003cp>If a website feels like filling out a form at the bank, we have already failed. Play is a feature.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"faq\">\n      \u003ch2>Questions? Good.\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q open\">\n        \u003cbutton>Is this style actually usable? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Yes — borders and colour do the hierarchy work that subtle shadows normally do. Contrast is high, targets are big, and nothing important is hidden.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q\">\n        \u003cbutton>Why not just use a gradient like everyone else? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Because gradients whisper and blocks shout. Your brand deserves a website people screenshot and send to their friends.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"q\">\n        \u003cbutton>How much does a site like this cost? \u003cspan class=\"plus\">+\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"a\">\u003cp>Less than you spent on the logo nobody can read. Every project is quoted flat — no hourly billing, no surprises.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\u003cspan class=\"flogo\">BLOK!\u003c/span>\u003csmall>© 2026 Blok Studio JB — borders on everything, colour on everything else.\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    document.querySelectorAll('.q > button').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const item = btn.parentElement;\n        const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');\n        document.querySelectorAll('.q').forEach(q => q.classList.remove('open'));\n        if (!isOpen) item.classList.add('open');\n      });\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}